    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-106" id="fn-106" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Other Service (j) represents the total MWHr of EIM Transfer utilizing ATC (PSE OATT, Attachment O, section 5.3) for the day and hour of the monthly peak.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-107" id="fn-107" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Day and Hour of Monthly Peak in columns (c) and (d) were left blank due to the fact that Network Service plus the Long-Term Firm Service and Short-Term Firm Service for the month were the same value for multiple hours on the same day.</link:footnote>
